Package: linearAlgebra
Title: Linear Algebra Helpers
Version: 0.0.3
Authors@R: 
    person(given = "Ivan Jacob Agaloos",
           family = "Pesigan",
           role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
           email = "r.jeksterslab@gmail.com",
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0003-4818-8420"))
Description: Linear algebra helpers: vectorization and half-vectorization,
    symmetric matrices from their half-vectorization, the duplication
    matrix and its Moore-Penrose inverse, deviation scores, and tests for
    symmetric and positive definite matrices.
    Each exported function has an internal version without input checks
    that other projects can copy.
